10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FbGgnClXnM8Q7kNvwEWy71Z&_nc_oc=AdoBSyHogfCNWOIhws5beYDy2394UlmnCJCuIBH3zIT3pDPUtCQuqmUk1xv_xWRbsCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-MW5yIyLZrrR4pRwC6JGzAsVf37uddRPFyROT-ykLhrQ&oe=6A32AE4C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EzjCxgQ_P_MQ7kNvwGUc-QT&_nc_oc=Adr1GJ9f3PLGgXO5zZYgyg8VCIuCZwQmFRU3eZ3xHcoQo21I9dEwfTyxmLcubqJeknk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_kkcbI45tyKePW6Dfdkl7oQT3jQniicQn7c6JZCPPk0g&oe=6A32BF3C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fp2Pg1ZmLScQ7kNvwH0RlOg&_nc_oc=Adqj13O8pXb2v6NJCMzHo0ABubpB5aOuSlUkbWM7TA06YzdeMTcSQO_wgNvXNE_-zrk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_UasnO1s4r4ZvsJWcBsFDZCUfwbZ2teybzrQAM26WUlg&oe=6A329E2B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore